   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Train Train** (1 review): The listener singles out Train Train as a song they would happily replay daily [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Katie Daly**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-02-05** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 44 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **ZOOM0027_201902**: source not stated; 7 songs; 42 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The recorded performance was an opening set by the band [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-02-05**: taped by Scott Plumer; transferred by Scott Plumer; source: Beyerdynamic MCE86II > ART Phantom II > Marantz PMD660 [1]. Also: Scott made the recording, and the listener credits his Beyer microphones for how it came out [4]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2019-02-05 - House of Blues, Cleveland, OH](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/06/billy-strings-2019-02-05-house-of-blues.html) [6]",
